  "longBusinessSummary": "11880 Solutions AG, together with its subsidiaries, offers telephone directory assistance services to private and business customers in Germany. It operates in two segments, Digital and Directory Assistance. The company provides online marketing services for small and medium-sized enterprises, and secretarial and call center services. It also offers companies with an online presence with products, such as company websites, Google Ads or Microsoft Advertising, search engine optimization, online advertising, search engine advertising, usability optimization, website analysis, Google My Business, and Facebook company pages, as well as supports them in the planning and implementation of digital advertising. In addition, the company provides a recruiting platform; Addressable TV, which delivers TV advertising targeted at specific customer audiences; and 11880.com app; werkenntdenBESTEN.de, a search engine for online reviews; and advertisement entry services advertisement products. 11880 Solutions AG was formerly known as telegate AG and changed its name to 11880 Solutions AG in June 2016. The company was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Essen, Germany. 11880 Solutions AG operates as a subsidiary of united vertical media GmbH.",
